The upstream project supplies the Android shell/app_process architecture,
VirtualDisplay automation, UI/OCR interaction, display-targeted input,
H.264 preview, Android controller, and browser launcher.

This derivative adds or changes execution extensions, independent result
verification, manual handoffs, scheduling and conflict handling, reusable
skills, voice and screen-context input, floating controls, task history,
metrics, Huawei compatibility, and retained-result transfer. Details and
revision references are in docs/DERIVATIVE_CHANGES.md and Git history.

